   "text": "坑A 关节顺序: URDF字典序反、含gripper、漏pan -> 必须按 base到末端 链 [pan,lift,elbow,wrist_flex,wrist_roll]\n坑B 末端把手: gripper_frame 有 98mm, FK漏算导致把手砸桌 -> 已在末尾补 Ttool 偏移",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
