   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "核心发现: 真机误差 ≠ 软件误差",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "核心发现: 真机误差 ≠ 软件误差",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "e1064",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 1496,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 143,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 12779,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "软件层: 数值0.9 / 神经15 / 混合0.9 mm (差16倍)\n真机层: 三方法全是 35~36 mm (几乎一样!)\n\n为什么? 主体是机械误差(~33mm):\n  · 肩部重力下垂 ~4.6°\n  · 开环控制 + 齿轮间隙\n→ IK再准也被机械误差淹没\n→ 结论: 仿真精度 ≠ 真机精度",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "软件层: 数值0.9 / 神经15 / 混合0.9 mm (差16倍)\n真机层: 三方法全是 35~36 mm (几乎一样!)\n\n为什么? 主体是机械误差(~33mm):\n  · 肩部重力下垂 ~4.6°\n  · 开环控制 + 齿轮间隙\n→ IK再准也被机械误差淹没\n→ 结论: 仿真精度 ≠ 真机精度",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
